# Devo process

Same process as Antiporn. Do not invent a different workflow.

- **Cloud agents:** web app, backend, GCP, GitHub, docs.
- **Local Mac only:** overlay, audio, camera, native client, installer, simulator.

Not cloud-only. Not strictly local. A Linux cloud VM cannot drive local camera, audio, or UI.

Holding: Devo. GitHub `atla-o`. GCP project `devo-holding` (org `atla-o.com`, folder `Devo`). App data is GCP, not Firebase.
